<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Terms of Service & Privacy Policy</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --accent-color: #6366f1;
            --accent-hover: #4f46e5;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .tab-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .tab-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .tab-btn:hover {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .tab-btn.active {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        .content-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
        }

        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-top: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        h2:first-of-type {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        p, ul {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .content-card {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .tab-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .tab-btn {
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 id="page-title">[Your Application Name] Legal Documents</h1>
            <p>Last updated: October 2, 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-buttons">
            <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('tos')">Terms of Service</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('privacy')">Privacy Policy</button>
        </div>

        <div class="content-card">
            <!-- TERMS OF SERVICE -->
            <div id="tos" class="tab-content active">
                <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                <p>By accessing or using This Service, including our Discord bot and associated web features, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the Service.</p>

                <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
                <p>This bot provides entertainment services, including virtual mini-games (e.g., Blackjack, Poker) and virtual economy features. All currency, points, or balances within the Service are purely virtual and have no real-world monetary value.</p>

                <h2>3. Virtual Currency and Items</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Virtual currency ("Coins", "Money", "Balance") cannot be exchanged for real currency, goods, or services.</li>
                    <li>We reserve the right to reset, modify, or adjust virtual balances at any time for balancing, debugging, or rule-enforcement purposes.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. User Conduct & Abuse</h2>
                <p>When using the Service, you agree not to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Use exploits, bugs, automation scripts, or third-party tools to gain an unfair advantage or farm virtual currency.</li>
                    <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or reverse-engineer the bot or its infrastructure.</li>
                    <li>Harass, abuse, or engage in malicious behavior towards other users through the Service.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
                <p>The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any service interruptions, data loss, or loss of virtual items/balances.</p>

                <h2>6. Termination</h2>
                <p>We reserve the right to terminate or restrict your access to the Service immediately, without prior notice, if you violate these Terms of Service.</p>

                <h2>7. Changes to Terms</h2>
                <p>We reserve the right to update these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- PRIVACY POLICY -->
            <div id="privacy" class="tab-content">
                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>We collect limited information necessary to operate and provide the Service:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Discord User Data:</strong> Discord User ID, username, and avatar URL to identify your account and save your progress.</li>
                    <li><strong>Gameplay & Economy Data:</strong> In-game virtual balances, transaction histories, daily streak information, and game stats.</li>
                    <li><strong>Command Usage Logs:</strong> Temporary technical logs to monitor errors, debug issues, and prevent abuse.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
                <p>We use collected data solely for:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Maintaining and providing core bot functionality and economy tracking.</li>
                    <li>Preventing cheating, exploits, and abuse of the bot.</li>
                    <li>Debugging errors and improving user experience.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Data Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
                <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties. Data is only accessible to authorized developers/owners of [Your Application Name].</p>

                <h2>4. Data Retention and Removal</h2>
                <p>Your user data is stored as long as you use the Service. If you wish to have your data permanently removed from our databases, please contact us or submit a deletion request via our support server/contact email.</p>

                <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
                <p>Our bot operates on the Discord platform. Your use of Discord is subject to the <a href="https://discord.com/terms" style="color: var(--accent-color);" target="_blank">Discord Terms of Service</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/privacy" style="color: var(--accent-color);" target="_blank">Discord Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to request data deletion, please contact the bot owner or visit our support server.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Clipper.AI . All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function switchTab(tabName) {
            // Hide all tab content
            const contents = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content');
            contents.forEach(content => content.classList.remove('active'));

            // Deactivate all buttons
            const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn');
            buttons.forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));

            // Show selected tab content and activate corresponding button
            document.getElementById(tabName).classList.add('active');
            
            const activeButton = Array.from(buttons).find(btn => 
                btn.getAttribute('onclick').includes(tabName)
            );
            if (activeButton) {
                activeButton.classList.add('active');
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
